# iCloud Drive sync-conflict duplicates ("cart 2.md", "shop 2.css").
# The vault lives in iCloud, and switching branches makes files appear and
# disappear underneath it, which iCloud sometimes resolves by leaving a copy.
# They're byte-identical junk — never commit them.
*\ [0-9].*
